            "review_title": "Review at Bonchon Chicken Vietnam",
            "review_text": "donewms\nBellingham, Washington42 contributions\n1\nAbove and Beyond\nOct 2019\nI really like Original Bonchon Chicken! So glad to see the franchise show up in Hanoi. Today was my second time to visit. First time not at all impressed. The normal portions were like a 1/3 the size in Thailand. In fact, swore I wouldn’t be back. \n\nWell today I just couldn’t resist the idea of the crunchy goodness so this afternoon I popped back in. Was I glad I gave the franchise a second chance. Not only was the 16 piece, now the price of an 8 piece nearly rectifying the former portion size but when the gas ran while making my order which caused a delay the wait staff, Mr. Tai, brought out a delicious salad. \n\nMr. Tai is the kind of employee every business dreams of employing. Bonchon should consider him for a future management position. Great English, incredibly pleasant personality, advocate for both the customers and owner! Definitely someone worth keeping as he went above and beyond! \n\nI will be back thanks to Tai, great tasting and better portioned food for the price.\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2019",
